        defendant: [.direct("Did you have the pills in your pocket?", "\"Yes, I did. A friend asked me to hold them for a little while, and I said yes without thinking about what it meant.\""), .direct("Whose pills were they?", "\"They belonged to my friend, who texted me about picking them up that evening. I showed that text to the deputy right at the gas station.\""), .direct("Why did you agree to hold them?", "\"My friend said there was somewhere to be and nowhere safe to keep them. I wanted to help, and I should have said no.\""), .direct("Did you use any of them?", "\"No, I never took one. I don't use that kind of drug, and I wasn't holding them for any reason of my own.\""), .direct("What did you do when the deputy approached you?", "\"I handed the pills over right away and told him whose they were. I didn't try to hide them or drive off.\""), .direct("What will you do now?", "\"I'll get help for the problems that keep putting me around this, and I'll stay away from friends who ask me to hold things for them.\""), .cross("You have been in this court before, haven't you?", "\"Yes, and I should have said no to my friend. I knew better, and I'm sorry that I didn't.\""), .cross("You had no prescription for the pills, did you?", "\"No, I did not. They weren't mine, so there was no prescription, and I didn't ask my friend for one.\""), .cross("The pills were not labeled, were they?", "\"No, there was nothing on the bag. I should have realized that was a warning sign.\""), .cross("You never asked what they were before you took them, did you?", "\"No, I didn't ask. I just said yes to my friend, and I regret not asking.\""), .cross("Your friend hasn't answered the deputy, has she?", "\"No, not as far as I know, and I've been trying to reach her myself without luck.\"")],
