        closings: ("The camera shows {D} swiping a stranger's cards three times for $380, with the owner's address in the purse. {DL} came through this court in {PRIORDATE} when the case concerned {PRIOR}. Using a found card is stealing.", "{DL} found the purse and meant to return it. {D.He} made a bad decision, and has said that {D.he} will repay the $380. A person who admits the mistake and offers to repay is not a hardened thief."),
