        allocution: "\"A friend told me I could have that diesel, and I siphoned it from the dump truck without checking with its owner. I've been in this courtroom before about the same thing. I'll pay for every gallon, and I'll stop taking fuel from anywhere that isn't mine.\"",
        truths: ("A hose was in {DL}'s truck and a can of diesel was found in the bed.", "The owner never gave anyone permission, and the friend who told {DL} has not been identified."),
        defendant: [.direct("Did you siphon diesel from the dump truck?", "\"Yes, I did. A friend told me I could have it, and I took it without checking with the owner.\""), .direct("What did your friend tell you about the truck?", "\"That it was left at the site for good and the diesel was free for anyone who wanted it. I took my friend's word for it.\""), .direct("Why didn't you check with the owner?", "\"I didn't know who owned the truck, and I assumed it was a throwaway. I should have asked around the site before I touched it.\""), .direct("What did you do with the diesel you took?", "\"I put some in my own truck and kept a can for a generator at home. I had already used part of it before the deputies came.\""), .direct("Why was a hose in your truck?", "\"I keep one there for moving fuel between my own tanks. I've used it before for my own equipment, and it was an old habit.\""), .direct("What will you do now?", "\"I'll pay for every gallon, and I'll stop taking fuel from anywhere that isn't mine. I'm sorry for the trouble to the owner.\""), .cross("You have been in this court before about the same thing, haven't you?", "\"Yes, and I should have known better than to take fuel on a stranger's word. I'm sorry that I put myself back here.\""), .cross("Your friend isn't here to say that the diesel was free, is he?", "\"No, he isn't, and I've been trying to reach him. He hasn't answered any of my calls since the deputies came.\""), .cross("You took about seventy gallons, didn't you?", "\"Yes, about that much, over a couple of nights. It's a lot, and I'm ready to pay for all of it.\""), .cross("You never asked anyone before you took it, did you?", "\"No, I didn't ask anyone, and I wish I had. A single question would have stopped me.\""), .cross("The truck was parked at a working job site, wasn't it?", "\"Yes, it was. I should have seen that it wasn't abandoned, because there were tools and other trucks nearby.\"")],
        openings: ("A dump truck owner found that diesel had been siphoned from {V.his} truck's tank, and deputies found a can of diesel and a hose in {D}'s truck. The fuel was worth $330. This is not {DL}'s first time here, since {PRIORDATE} brought {D.him} in once already over {PRIOR}.", "{DL} says a friend told {D.him} that {D.he} could have the diesel, and {D.he} took it believing it was a gift. The defense will show that {D.he} did not know the friend had no right to give it away."),
        closings: ("A hose and a can of diesel were in {D}'s truck, and the dump truck's tank was siphoned. The diesel was worth $330. {DL} has appeared in this courtroom before, back in {PRIORDATE} over {PRIOR}.", "A friend told {D} that the diesel was free for the taking, and {D} believed it. {DL} did not check with the owner, and has promised to pay for every gallon."),
